nansum(input, *, dtype=None) -> Tensor

Returns the sum of all elements, treating Not a Numbers (NaNs) as zero.

Args:
    input (Tensor): the input tensor.

Keyword args:
    dtype (:class:`torch.dtype`, optional): the desired data type of returned tensor.
